              "formula_attributes": null,
              "style": "156"
            },
            {
              "ref": "B43",
              "type": "str",
              "value": "Store both facts. Do not erase the tension by forcing 'Bhishma is only Dyu' or 'Bhishma is only a composite'. The source supports a boundary-member identity plus whole-class contribution structure.",
