              "value": "Separates Gathic/Younger Avestan/Pahlavi strata; identifies a strong sevenfold spiritual↔material counterpart system, mirrored adversarial relations, 16×2 countercreation grammar, repeated 6+1 heptad forms and menog→getig materialization. Rejects the late 4×3 Great Year as independent musical topology and finds no external 3×4 confirmation. Adds explicit scale-transition taxonomy and future sequence through Celtic and Sefer Yetzirah.",
